1794959022801209	sippycup-2u2m2v	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-guh	{"body":"2026-11-17: a loopback dress rehearsal against a standards-compliant SIP stack found five defects in the live path (campaign preflight Via/rport, closed container stdin, unresolvable host-network hostname, work-path handling in isolated mode, preflight exit status), fixed in 526b854. The guided workflow is still seven manual steps; bn-2ky adds the single-command executor this gate should prove, and bn-yfj the local target to rehearse it on. Still waiting on Quad's written scope; no live traffic has been sent."}	blake3:_-b53GLE6hk80J4FMxTIEZFp6r6Wkp67JEnbrq80qEA
